function paintBoxes(ctx,f,origin,facing){if(!f)return;const drawBox=(box,color)=>{const flip=facing*(f.flags?.includes('H')?-1:1),flipY=f.flags?.includes('V')?-1:1,x1=box[0]*flip,x2=box[2]*flip,y1=box[1]*flipY,y2=box[3]*flipY;ctx.fillStyle=color+'28';ctx.strokeStyle=color;ctx.fillRect(origin.x+Math.min(x1,x2)*viewZoom,origin.y+Math.min(y1,y2)*viewZoom,Math.abs(x2-x1)*viewZoom,Math.abs(y2-y1)*viewZoom);ctx.strokeRect(origin.x+Math.min(x1,x2)*viewZoom,origin.y+Math.min(y1,y2)*viewZoom,Math.abs(x2-x1)*viewZoom,Math.abs(y2-y1)*viewZoom)};if(showClsn2)for(const b of f.clsn2||[])drawBox(b,f.clsn2Source==='default'?'#b26cff':'#3d8dff');if(showClsn1)for(const b of f.clsn1||[])drawBox(b,f.clsn1Source==='default'?'#ffd84a':'#ff3b45')}
function paint(ctx,f,origin,facing,alpha=1,dark=false){if(!f)return;const info=f.image,img=image(info);if(!img?.complete)return;ctx.save();ctx.globalAlpha=alpha;if(dark)ctx.filter='brightness(.42) saturate(.6)';ctx.translate(origin.x+(f.x||0)*viewZoom,origin.y+(f.y||0)*viewZoom);ctx.scale(facing*(f.flags?.includes('H')?-viewZoom:viewZoom),f.flags?.includes('V')?-viewZoom:viewZoom);ctx.imageSmoothingEnabled=false;ctx.drawImage(img,-info.axisX,-info.axisY);ctx.restore();paintBoxes(ctx,f,{x:origin.x+(f.x||0)*viewZoom,y:origin.y+(f.y||0)*viewZoom},facing)}
function activeParts(){return plan.parts.filter(p=>tick>=p.createTick&&(p.removeTick<0||tick<p.removeTick)).map(p=>({part:p,track:model.partTracks?.[p.anim],frame:frameAt(model.partTracks?.[p.anim],Math.max(0,tick-p.createTick))})).filter(x=>x.frame)}
function paintParts(ctx,lane,o1,o2){for(const item of activeParts().filter(x=>x.part.lane===lane)){const origin=item.part.owner==='P2'?o2:o1,facing=item.part.owner==='P2'?(Number(plan.p2Facing)||-1):(Number(plan.p1Facing)||1);if(partOnion)paint(ctx,frameAt(item.track,Math.max(0,tick-item.part.createTick-1)),origin,facing,.2,true);paint(ctx,item.frame,origin,facing,.9,false)}}
function origins(){const c=$('canvas'),bind=selectedBind()||{x:35,y:0},o1={x:c.width*.36+panX,y:c.height*.8+panY};return{o1,o2:{x:o1.x+Number(bind.x)*viewZoom,y:o1.y+Number(bind.y)*viewZoom},bind}}
function saveView(){vscode.setState({...saved,viewZoom,panX,panY})}
function setViewZoom(next,pointer){const c=$('canvas'),old=viewZoom,value=Math.max(.25,Math.min(8,Number(next)||1));if(pointer){const r=c.getBoundingClientRect(),px=(pointer.clientX-r.left)*c.width/r.width,py=(pointer.clientY-r.top)*c.height/r.height,bx=c.width*.36,by=c.height*.8;panX=px-bx-(px-bx-panX)*value/old;panY=py-by-(py-by-panY)*value/old}viewZoom=value;$('viewZoom').value=Math.round(value*100);$('viewZoomValue').textContent=Math.round(value*100)+'%';saveView();draw()}
function centerView(){panX=0;panY=0;saveView();draw()}
